l funding for the region. Kirkland, a casino executive, has emphasized agriculture and water issues but has raised little money.\n\nThe financial picture is lopsided: Costa has nearly $939,000 on hand while Kirkland has under $20,000, and no significant outside spending is active in the race. Expert raters across the spectrum call the seat Safe or Solid Democratic, and prediction markets give Costa roughly a 93-94% chance of winning. With no public general-election polling available, the forecast rests on fundamentals, which point to a double-digit Democratic margin.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.9799, "margin": 14.05}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.9726, "margin": 13.0}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.9754, "margin": 14.0}, {"date": "2026-09-25", "p_dem": 0.9684, "margin": 13.5}, {"date": "2026-09-26", "p_dem": 0.9588, "margin": 13.0}, {"date": "2026-09-27", "p_dem": 0.957, "margin": 13.5}, {"date": "2026-09-28", "p_dem": 0.9737, "margin": 14.0}, {"date": "2026-09-29", "p_dem": 0.9821, "margin": 14.0}]}